(
    title: "Crayon Shin-chan: Ora to Shiro wa Otomodachi Da yo",
    developer: Some("Tose"),
    description: Some("Shinnosuke walks, climbs telegraph poles and trees, hides behind scenery to let bullies past and ducks into shops across four stages — an errand into town, a kindergarten outing, walking the dog, then hunting for the dog he mislaid. Minigames along the way can add a life. A touch, a pit or the timer costs one, and there is no continue."),
